# Frontend environment template — copy to .env and fill in.
# Names only: never commit real values. `.env` is git-ignored.

# --- SEO -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absolute site origin, scheme included. Everything derived from it: canonical
# URLs, og:image, robots.txt and the sitemap. Optional — src/utils/seo.ts falls
# back to https://code29.dev. A value without a scheme fails the build on purpose.
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# --- Analytics -------------------------------------------------------------
# GA4 measurement ID. The tag loads only after the visitor grants analytics
# consent; leave it unset and no analytics script is rendered at all.
# PUBLIC_GA4_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# --- Contact form (POST /api/contact) --------------------------------------
# All three are required. If any is missing the endpoint answers 503 instead of
# failing silently.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_key_here
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=you@example.com
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@your-verified-domain.com
